# ─── AI Chatbot ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# HOW IT WORKS:
#   Deployed on Vercel  →  /api/chat serverless runs  →  use keys WITHOUT VITE_ prefix (server-side, secure)
#   Local `npm run dev` →  no serverless             →  use keys WITH VITE_ prefix    (browser fallback)
#   Claude needs `npx vercel dev` locally (Anthropic blocks browser CORS)
#
# RECOMMENDATION: Set BOTH versions of whichever key you have.
# Example with OpenAI:
#   OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...          ← used by /api/chat on Vercel (never in browser)
#   VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...     ← same value, used for local npm run dev fallback
#
# AUTO-DETECTION: Leave AI_PROVIDER blank → it picks whichever key is present.
# Priority if multiple keys exist: openai > gemini > claude
# Override with: AI_PROVIDER=gemini

# ── Explicit override (optional) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
AI_PROVIDER=
VITE_AI_PROVIDER=

# ── OpenAI  (model: gpt-4o-mini) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
OPENAI_API_KEY=
VITE_OPENAI_API_KEY=

# ── Google Gemini  (model: gemini-2.0-flash) ──────────────────────────────────
GEMINI_API_KEY=
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# ── Anthropic Claude  (model: claude-haiku-4-5-20251001) ──────────────────────
# Claude ONLY works via /api/chat (serverless). Use `npx vercel dev` locally.
CLAUDE_API_KEY=

# ─── Contact Form ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 1. Go to https://formspree.io → sign up → New Form
# 2. Copy the ID from the URL: formspree.io/f/XXXXXXXX
# 3. Paste it below (just the ID, not the full URL)
VITE_FORMSPREE_ID=
